The firmware of the NVIDIA graphics adapters of this machine is placed in
/boot/firmware/nvidia by the tool.

The tool fetches the file the adapters need from download.nvidia.com and
checks its size and its hash against the pin table before it puts it in
place.  A machine that has no network can take the file from a directory
of its own:

	nvidia-firmware fetch --from /path/to/the/files

The nvidia module has to be unloaded before the tool can take a file away
from /boot/firmware/nvidia.
